      "description": "**The funnel.** Distinct installs that saw each coach mark. Sorted by value, which *is* curriculum order: a later step can only ever have fewer installs than an earlier one, so the list reads top to bottom as the script.\n\nThe pair to watch is `MarkSquare` and `PlaceDog` — the two gesture steps, and the only ones a player cannot leave by tapping anywhere. A fall across either of those is a gesture people cannot perform, not a lesson they did not read.\n\n`step` is the enum name and not an index on purpose: the curriculum will be reordered, and a funnel keyed on position would silently start comparing two different lessons. A step that is skipped because it has nothing to point at never fires at all, so an absent bar is not a drop-off.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
